{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:23:58.492Z","ordinal":454506,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-8d2f658e-312c-42f2-88f6-321ff7318b56","process_id":"75130","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n '40564959805|cross.runner|REQ-REL-114|ACC-SUP-08' /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -30; sed -n '88,110p' /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md; find /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10 -maxdepth 2 -type f | rg 'repro|cross|provider' | head -30"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n '40564959805|cross.runner|REQ-REL-114|ACC-SUP-08' /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md","query":"40564959805|cross.runner|REQ-REL-114|ACC-SUP-08","path":"READINESS.md"},{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '88,110p' /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md","name":"READINESS.md","path":"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md"},{"type":"list_files","cmd":"find /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10 -maxdepth 2 -type f","path":"rc.10"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg 'repro|cross|provider'","query":"repro|cross|provider","path":null}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"13:Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned; its last update was 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC, with no custodian response observed. No held-out payload was accessed and no held-out qualification was run. The manual terminal matrix's last recorded result is 0/15; terminal setup exists on Ubuntu, but no operator screenshots or cell verdicts have been supplied. Exact-RC held-out/T2/T3/T4, live provider and standalone checks, cross-runner reproducibility, the human terminal matrix, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain outstanding.\n27:**Qualification, custody, and publication:** GitHub still lists [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) as the latest release; there is no `v1.0.0` tag or stable release. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned, with the last metadata-only custodian request at 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC and no response observed. No protected payload was accessed or qualification run. The manual terminal matrix remains 0/15; the final installed RC does not exist. Exact-RC held-out/T2/T3/T4, provider and standalone coverage, cross-runner reproducibility, human terminal evidence, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain outstanding. The chosen distribution target remains the GitHub installer; npm publication is inapplicable.\n41:**Qualification and custody:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` is still the latest release (published 2026-10-27); the package at `b293b44` is also `1.0.0-rc.10`, so source changes require a successor RC before installed-RC qualification. No accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 exists. Held-out issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open; its latest public status request was posted 2026-10-28 12:42 UTC, with no custodian response as of this checkpoint. The public 40-task manifest is not custody acceptance, and no held-out qualification has started. T2/T3/T4, evaluator/custody acceptance, remaining provider and standalone gates, cross-runner reproducibility, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. The manual five-terminal by three-size matrix remains 0/15; the Ubuntu desktop has setup evidence only, with no qualifying screenshots or cell verdicts recorded.\n57:**Qualification and publication:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the latest prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0`