{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:25:08.258Z","ordinal":454570,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a18354-63a2-7f52-be6c-b32159ed40d0","call_id":"call_07cfba46070e4b59a15d4f5f2d8b2b85","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"No held-out status change since the prior review. At `origin/main@ceaf60072b7c364edac523d2517fb12df8f5f6cd` (merge #295, `2026-10-28T03:01:55-04:00`), the T2 and T3 manifest hashes and coverage remain unchanged.\\n\\nIssue #1 remains open; last updated `2026-10-27T18:47:09Z`. Its latest comment, #6450709480, is still a coordinator request; no custodian response or handoff is visible. Claims show no active held-out owner.\\n\\nThe T2 report’s historical custody acceptance still separates evaluator-boundary acceptance. The current evaluator continues to reject T2’s legacy format for qualification, and the readiness record remains blocked. No new qualification or fresh acceptance evidence is recorded.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — reviewed head `a56432d7c6b00ee3a798023b887047052c5cba1a` against base `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`; diff SHA-256 `9c48e0b153fc31718cc9e43d6ff14b40576650b5c52a61cb00f26043603a30bb`. The diff changes only `docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md`.\\n\\nThe checkpoint overstates the outstanding work:\\n\\n- Line 11 says no exact-RC qualification has started, but the existing RC10 cross-runner record reports a pass for the exact published RC10 artifact. Line 13 also says cross-runner reproducibility is outstanding. Clarify that the *successor RC* still needs that evidence; RC10’s completed evidence does not establish overall acceptance.\\n- The provider-status wording should distinguish existing RC10 provider evidence from remaining provider acceptance coverage.\\n- The 16:16 snapshot matched live status at that time, but PR #302 has since advanced from `662d084` to `49a2af0`; PR #300’s CodeQL check also succeeded while its CI remained in progress. Refresh these statuses if this is meant to be the current checkpoint.\\n\\nNo tests were run.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","create_time":1793204708.2588408}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
