s split into category modules (`cli/src/core/capabilities.ts`, 10,046 bytes, plus `capability_definitions/`); scheduler logic is in `cli/src/core/scheduler.ts` (23,696 bytes), with `operation.ts` reduced to 12,818 bytes; runner revalidation, execution, and persistence are separated from `operation_runner.ts` (14,931 bytes). Runner decomposition and bounded revalidation/runner diagnostics were integrated through PR [#287](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/287); TDD evidence diagnostics landed through PR [#295](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/295), and scheduler observer diagnostics through PR [#296](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/296). PR [#297](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/297), now merged, adds regression coverage for the TDD diagnostic paths. The capability split and scheduler extraction were integrated through PRs [#286](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/286) and [#285](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/285), respectively. PR [#293](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/293) added operator guidance for `DecisionRejected` and is merged with its Node 22/24, Linux, and CodeQL checks successful. These source changes are implemented on current `main`.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:65:**Integration queue:** PR #285 merged to `d3b7af3`; its exact diff hash and independent ACCEPT were preserved, and the initial state-store lock timeout did not reproduce in its full Linux retry. PR [#289](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/289) is refreshed onto `d3b7af3` at `3f66ee138b1d8aeded2902851f659873d887f307`; its seven-file patch SHA-256 remains `3e13bdaa…`. Fresh Node 22/24/JavaScript checks and Entire Gates are in progress. The first fresh reviewer response described only the docs file, but the GitHub and local diff both contain six implementation/test files plus docs; a complete read-only source review has been requested, so the rebase is not independently a