{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:33:02.815Z","ordinal":454873,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a1835b-a15f-7d30-b037-1cce22071d67","role":"developer","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Current: 2026-10-28 4:33pm UTC\nThis file has prior observations — supplementary context follows. The Read result below is the full requested section.\n- **Need details on a past observation?** get_observations([IDs]) — ~300 tokens each.\n- **Need a structural map first?** smart_outline(\"cli/src/core/operation.ts\") — line numbers only, cheaper than re-reading.\n### Oct 8, 2026\n14101 3:12a 🔵 ConvergenceScheduler — BLOCKED Required + Rate-Limited Advisory Yields WAITING, Not BLOCKED\n14122 8:08a 🔵 Remediation Branch a27901c — Three-Fix Campaign Against I1, I6, and G Invariants\n### Oct 11, 2026\n15423 2:59p 🔵 run_19ca1b1_prov_deep120 Early Run Metrics — Step 21 Mid-Run Status\n15439 3:13p 🔵 Shipped .env Template and Image Format Pattern Documented\n15738 6:10p 🔵 OperationStore.save: taskId and sessionId Both Set to op.id\n### Oct 12, 2026\n16150 9:47a 🔵 R1 Agent Reasoning Trace — Key Findings from Architecture Review Investigation\n### Oct 14, 2026\n17672 11:03p 🟣 A2 Verification Audit Report Finalized: 12 Requirements Proposed, VER-01 Through VER-12\n### Oct 28, 2026\n23616 6:29a ⚖️ Code Review Enhancement Audit Complete — All Structural Items Already Shipped, Only Eval Corpus Remains Open\n23867 3:54p 🟣 PR #306 Context Budget Implementation — Pre-Inference Admission Check with contextBudgetFailure()\n\n---\n\nCurrent: 2026-10-28 4:33pm UTC\nThis file has prior observations — supplementary context follows. The Read result below is the full requested section.\n- **Need details on a past observation?** get_observations([IDs]) — ~300 tokens each.\n- **Need a structural map first?** smart_outline(\"cli/src/core/operation_runner.ts\") — line numbers only, cheaper than re-reading.\n### Oct 8, 2026\n14151 8:28a 🔵 AutonomousAgent Instantiation Sites — evaluator