ccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\\n\\n\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_update_ref\",\"description\":\"Access repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\\n\\n\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__github_update_review_comment\",\"description\":\"Access repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\\n\\n\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read\",\"description\":\"Read this project's to-do lists and working state written with work_state_write: every ope\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write\",\"description\":\"Your canonical to-do list and working state for this project, kept across sessions: whatev\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_autoindex_remove\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_batch_search\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_brain_ego\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_brain_link\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_brain_overview\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_brain_unlink\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_code_search\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_corpus_feedback\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_def\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_field_report\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_hub_ask\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_hub_def\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_hub_find\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_hybrid_search\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_index_budget\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_map\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_memory_recall\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_memory_store\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_plan\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_search\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xerj_semantic_search\",\"description\":\"XERJ tools proxy to a running XERJ engine (ES-compatible). Use xerj_search for retrieval —\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__xerj__xer