{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:49:16.787Z","ordinal":455488,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1836a-7df3-7a02-b1c0-1453c0476790","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** for exact delta `35c81484e34b4710d50ce80cc66e7b3aaa8b5ee1..934ed912b8e187c5c418709e472a6313bb4169a8`; delta SHA-256: `2d8f4b7b94f9e5588c651e45640bbd87754c2e83636a53380a4b9b87ca6bbc3b`.\n\nThe bounded snapshot and private Git probes address the prior ordinary-directory compatibility concern: the lookalike fixture’s invalid `HEAD` and config without `core.bare` should be allowed by the probe path, while an actual repository or `core.bare=true` is rejected ([checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:388), [checkpoint_restore.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts:1471)).\n\nThe config and HEAD must be regular files within size limits; reads use no-follow/nonblocking flags where available and verify descriptor identity and metadata. Include sections are rejected before invoking Git. The temporary probe uses a private directory, a scrubbed Git environment, bounded output and timeouts, and `finally` cleanup ([checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:393), [checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:402), [checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:436), [checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:441)).\n\nI did not run tests because SUITE is claimed; the ordinary-directory behavior is a source-level assessment, not fresh test evidence."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","create_time":1793206156.7873082}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":21802}}
