{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:50:24.016Z","ordinal":455553,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae227cf682881a0bc5f0ef159e9b9aa","status":"completed","call_id":"call_a2638f63a41c40539deaadb572f9efc9","name":"exec","input":"const n=[\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project\"]; for (const k of n){const t=ALL_TOOLS.find(y=>y.name===k);text(k+\"\\n\"+t.description.slice(0,1200))}\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","create_time":1793206223.4165242}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:50:24.118Z","ordinal":455554,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016ae227ce375481a09f94d403bdb03f03","usage":{"input_tokens":161366,"cached_input_tokens":160000,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":102,"reasoning_output_tokens":17,"total_tokens":161468},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":44307794,"cached_input_tokens":43763712,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":170958,"reasoning_output_tokens":99570,"total_tokens":44478752},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":8416064651,"cached_input_tokens":8326294528,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":23942935,"reasoning_output_tokens":13809757,"total_tokens":8440007586}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:50:24.121Z","ordinal":455555,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1836b-84f9-7d10-8fcf-54ec2c947c7f","call_id":"call_a2638f63a41c40539deaadb572f9efc9","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nList active window identities for a project.\n\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\n\nReturns\n-------\ndict\n    { identities: [{ id, window_uuid, display_name, created_ts, last_active_ts, expires_ts }] }\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities(args: { format?: string | null; project_key: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nList contact links for an agent in a project.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nIdempotently create or ensure a project exists for the given human key.\n\nWhen to use\n-----------\n- First call in a workflow targeting a new repo/path identifier.\n- As a guard before registering agents or sending messages.\n\nHow it works\n------------\n- Validates that `human_key` is an absolute directory path (the agent's working directory).\n- Computes a stable slug from `human_key` (lowercased, safe characters) so\n  multiple agents can refer to the same project consistently.\n- Ensures DB row exists and that the on-disk archive is initialized\n  (e.g., `messages/`, `agents/`, `file_reservations/` directories).\n\nCRITICAL: Project Identity Rules\n---------------------------------\n- The `human_key` MUST be the absolute path to the agent's working directory\n- Two agents working in the SAME directory path are working on the SAME project\n- Example: Both agents in /data/projects/smartedgar_mcp → SAME project\n- Sibling project"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","create_time":1793206224.1218133}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
