{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:51:40.654Z","ordinal":455612,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1836c-afeb-7fe2-84a9-1a1f8b46fb21","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** — exact PR head `934ed912b8e187c5c418709e472a6313bb4169a8` against base `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`; cumulative diff SHA-256: `3996f049429f286524facc2677440d71ba8fc4ea885665affe202648654da114`.\n\nI found no unresolved issue in the combined restore preflight, workspace-scoped index update, deletion ordering, or bounded private Git probe. The probe rejects symlink, FIFO, oversized, or changing config/HEAD inputs before Git reads them; it also rejects external include sections before probing. The ordinary directory fixture with Git-like names remains allowed by the snapshot probe path, while repository markers and `core.bare` are checked on the isolated copy.\n\n`git diff --check` passed. I did not run tests because SUITE is held. The worktree now contains uncommitted changes beyond head `934ed912`; this disposition covers only the exact committed base-to-head diff and not those later changes."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","create_time":1793206300.6515133}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":21805}}
