{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:02:18.772Z","ordinal":456073,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a18376-6c93-7850-a203-02a1a4aef4b6","call_id":"call_a95becae262b4ee3b75680b7981a021c","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"No held-out status change since the prior review. At `origin/main@ceaf60072b7c364edac523d2517fb12df8f5f6cd` (merge #295, `2026-10-28T03:01:55-04:00`), the T2 and T3 manifest hashes and coverage remain unchanged.\\n\\nIssue #1 remains open; last updated `2026-10-27T18:47:09Z`. Its latest comment, #6450709480, is still a coordinator request; no custodian response or handoff is visible. Claims show no active held-out owner.\\n\\nThe T2 report’s historical custody acceptance still separates evaluator-boundary acceptance. The current evaluator continues to reject T2’s legacy format for qualification, and the readiness record remains blocked. No new qualification or fresh acceptance evidence is recorded.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** for the 12-line delta atop `f8f6983c4cbfbe9b5fbbe70794b5648c39d60745`. Diff SHA-256: `43c08c28f4b43acb09d7c1cedb06550d0ca87c757dbffbed372f6e7fbc798888`.\\n\\n`gitNulEntries` now throws a dedicated `GitPathEncodingError` ([checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:35)), and checkpoint creation rethrows it instead of replacing the actionable UTF-8-path explanation with a generic protected-state error ([checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:957)). No issue found in this delta. `git diff --check` passed; I did not run tests.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","create_time":1793206938.7718806}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_to