{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:04:18.154Z","ordinal":456167,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-1103896d-d2b9-4b73-a263-154c7a908d5e","process_id":"96831","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 305 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeable,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup --jq '{headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeable,mergeStateStatus,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name,status,conclusion}]}' && gh pr view 305 --json body,title --jq '{title,body}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 305 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeable,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup --jq '{headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeable,mergeStateStatus,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name,status,conclusion}]}' && gh pr view 305 --json body,title --jq '{title,body}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefOid\":\"145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08\",\"checks\":[{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"FAILURE\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":null,\"status\":null}],\"headRefOid\":\"f0f4847af188f0bf029e018cc8147ddd94a06904\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNSTABLE\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\"}\n{\"body\":\"\\u003c!-- entire-trail-link-start --\\u003e\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/20/changes/nexus-code/20\\n\\u003c!-- entire-trail-link-end --\\u003e\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\n- On an explicit operator restart with usable recovered history, reset the unit agent conversation and prompt from the authorized task instead of resuming the previous conversation.\\n- Preserve the interrupted-tool inspection gate and existing verification obligations.\\n- Add a focused regression proving old conversation history is not continued on the restarted unit.\\n\\n## Background\\n\\nPR #304 merged this opt-in feature into `main` at `b2ae2fe`. Its independent review identified that `restart: true` could recreate a clean worktree while the executor resumed the old agent conversation. This PR addresses that finding.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT at base `b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212`, head `f7e573ec8de98fb3ec24a96e148a84b4ccab151f`, cumulative diff SHA-256 `cf1abd6ce5e7083aebe526efaaee85380dee295fced7814a7ddedcd609a11615`.\\n- `npm --prefix cli run build`: passed with isolated HOME.\\n- Focused TypeScript check of the new test: passed.\\n- Focused runtime test not run locally because the active `SUITE` claim is held by `kimi-main`; exact-head CI is required before merge.\\n\\nAcceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; this PR is source remediation, not release acceptance.\\n\",\"title\":\"fix(operation): restart unit conversation on fresh worktree\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":374704821}},"started_at_ms":1793207056750,"completed_at_ms":1793207058154}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:04:19.286Z","ordinal":456168,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18378-4355-79e2-b2d6-e7ef714a7b4a","call_id":"call_8c29bc10312b46fc999d047c202fe0ed","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"R1\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08\",\"checks\":[{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"FAILURE\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":null,\"status\":null}],\"headRefOid\":\"f0f4847af188f0bf029e018cc8147ddd94a06904\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNSTABLE\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\"}\n{\"body\":\"\\u003c!-- entire-trail-link-start --\\u003e\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/20/changes/nexus-code/20\\n\\u003c!-- entire-trail-link-end --\\u003e\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\n- On an explicit operator restart with usable recovered history, reset the unit agent conversation and prompt from the authorized task instead of resuming the previous conversation.\\n- Preserve the interrupted-tool inspection gate and existing verification obligations.\\n- Add a focused regression proving old conversation history is not continued on the restarted unit.\\n\\n## Background\\n\\nPR #304 merged this opt-in feature into `main` at `b2ae2fe`. Its independent review identified that `restart: true` could recreate a clean worktree while the executor resumed the old agent conversation. This PR addresses that finding.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT at base `b2ae2fe82640