{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:12:27.426Z","ordinal":456545,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1837f-b621-7f61-bb08-9e1e82937a60","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** for the uncommitted delta atop `cb31461ae5e2d5c5669b86ae670ea0d760757424` (SHA-256 `4f2a1a1c6d2ed574cbcefa9cdf0dc903377d1d44456899ac04a1d9a324f162e3`).\n\nThe probe now writes its bounded snapshots through the existing private-file helper ([checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:491)), and restore preserves a specific, safe nested-repository diagnosis while still refusing mutation ([checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:1239)). No issue found in this delta. `git diff --check` passed; I did not run tests."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","create_time":1793207547.4252956}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":21829}}
