{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:13:18.318Z","ordinal":456581,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-1a4b4215-fa32-4e85-b266-e8deb4e2c176","process_id":"67931","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix status --short --branch && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix log -1 --format='%H%n%P%n%s%n%an <%ae>%n%aI' && git -C /home/mike/nexus-code rev-parse origin/main && cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/V1_CHECKPOINT_UNTRACKED_OWNER_PR_20261028/owner.json && cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/SUITE/owner.json"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix status --short --branch && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix log -1 --format='%H%n%P%n%s%n%an <%ae>%n%aI' && git -C /home/mike/nexus-code rev-parse origin/main && cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/V1_CHECKPOINT_UNTRACKED_OWNER_PR_20261028/owner.json && cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/SUITE/owner.json"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"## v1/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix\n M cli/src/checkpoint.ts\n980ac35ac516f239440ef812327e4f25b865c03b\ncb31461ae5e2d5c5669b86ae670ea0d760757424\nfix(checkpoint): preserve nested repository rollback errors\nMike Holownych <mike@holownych.com>\n2026-10-28T17:12:31+00:00\n90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"base\": \"145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/defect-checkpoint-untracked-integration\",\n  \"head\": \"f8f6983c4cbfbe9b5fbbe70794b5648c39d60745\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"scope\": \"PR302 checkpoint restore safety: reject nested repository mutation paths while avoiding ordinary project directories named objects/refs; preserve exact preflight and regressions; no suite runs while SUITE is held.\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-28T12:15:00Z\",\n  \"status\": \"Independent review ACCEPTed the extension delta (exact delta SHA-256 38425b0e892f4a0741601516b23ca71a768dc4f08ef06955e6f5869ef47d8527), including the CR-root correction and regression. Committed locally at f8f6983c to preserve the reviewed patch; remote PR302 remains at 934ed912. TypeScript and diff-check pass. Tests are not run because kimi-main still owns SUITE. Original authorship of the extra delta remains unknown; patch backup /tmp/nexus-pr302-934-uncommitted-preserved.patch.\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix\",\n  \"last_updated\": \"2026-10-28T16:58:00Z\",\n  \"diff_sha256\": \"3ce144c3e6675032a8814851128e7c993964de9c395c266dad995a78b03f62ab\",\n  \"independent_review\": {\n    \"disposition\": \"ACCEPT\",\n    \"reviewer\": \"/root/review_pr302\",\n    \"base\": \"b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212\",\n    \"head\": \"3c52580ae1da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7\",\n    \"diff_sha256\": \"d90aeb05a9f5c5d0a35bfa0f597d96cc39a5f6480e22b20094f7523cd4cacdff\",\n    \"findings\": 0,\n    \"tests_run\": false,\n    \"confirmed_at\": \"2026-10-28T14:04:47Z\"\n  },\n  \"followup_review\": {\n    \"reviewer\": \"/root/review_pr302\",\n    \"disposition\": \"CHANGES_REQUIRED\",\n    \"head\": \"0f04bb58a3f4b7ee81ded48b8219983f6c92fba2\",\n    \"finding\": \"preflight checks only cp.untrackedFiles; tracked cp.gitRef path replaced by ignored directory can reach read-tree/checkout-index; tests do not assert index unchanged\",\n    \"tests_run\": false\n  },\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T14:03:00Z\",\n  \"remediation\": {\n    \"commit\": \"bb057ca69494084e2fcf37ba559b1077157b311a\",\n    \"files\": [\n      \"cli/src/checkpoint.ts\",\n      \"cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"finding\": \"tracked checkpoint tree blob paths were omitted from restore destination