{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:14:38.868Z","ordinal":456658,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-6b2ef8d6-777e-46f1-8f56-fb11d1e00286","process_id":"53087","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 300 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json title,body,baseRefName,baseRefOid,headRefName,headRefOid,mergeable,reviewDecision,files,commits; gh pr view 302 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json title,body,baseRefName,baseRefOid,headRefName,headRefOid,mergeable,reviewDecision,files,commits; gh run list --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --commit 8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b --limit 10 --json databaseId,name,status,conclusion,headSha,createdAt --jq '.[]|[.databaseId,.name,.status,.conclusion,.headSha,.createdAt]|@tsv'; cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_src_checkpoint.ts/owner.json"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 300 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json title,body,baseRefName,baseRefOid,headRefName,headRefOid,mergeable,reviewDecision,files,commits; gh pr view 302 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json title,body,baseRefName,baseRefOid,headRefName,headRefOid,mergeable,reviewDecision,files,commits; gh run list --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --commit 8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b --limit 10 --json databaseId,name,status,conclusion,headSha,createdAt --jq '.[]|[.databaseId,.name,.status,.conclusion,.headSha,.createdAt]|@tsv'; cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_src_checkpoint.ts/owner.json"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"baseRefOid\":\"145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08\",\"body\":\"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/15/changes/nexus-code/15\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\n## Purpose\\n\\nRecord the requested codebase-review findings and dogfooding follow-up in the v1.0.0 readiness artifact, bound to current source and qualification evidence.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n- Capability-category split, scheduler extraction, and operation-runner decomposition are integrated.\\n- Bounded diagnostics and `DecisionRejected` guidance are integrated with targeted tests.\\n- Lifecycle integration tests and 100 fixed-seed scheduler invariants are present; they do not prove every scheduler property.\\n- Operator configuration currently supports only `operationPolicy`; this does not claim all runtime defaults are configurable.\\n- The RC8 runtime-identity defect is fixed in merged PR #273 and covered by a focused regression. The fix postdates RC10 and still needs successor-RC verification.\\n- Malformed operator-config recovery remains tracked separately in PR #299; it is not represented as resolved by this documentation change.\\n- Pilot evaluation is not held-out acceptance. Independent 40-task custody and exact-RC qualification remain open.\\n- Readiness records active PR/CI evidence, current requirements status, latest RC, and unresolved acceptance gates without claiming acceptance.\\n\\n## Exact revision and validation\\n\\n- Base: `b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212`\\n- Head: `11dc196fcdd733f8de71dfc95ff70e109d8f4492`\\n- Cumulative diff SHA-256: `2ab25de0645cb96bc4f874f35e4f327817f93a29216c12ef463ad380192b6513`\\n- `git diff --check`: PASS\\n- Source requirements enforcement passed on exact base `b2ae2fe` (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals). This documentation-only update does not change the requirements source.\\n- Exact-head CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks: PASS.\\n- Exact-head Node 22 and 24 CI and Entire Gates: IN_PROGRESS as observed 2026-10-28 13:55 UTC.\\n- Independent factual review of this exact head: REQUESTED; pending.\\n\\nAcceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release is claimed.\\n\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T02:10:39Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:05:55Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"docs(release): refresh readiness checkpoint after PR 286\",\"oid\":\"e0c2648816bb5d0b0632d213d1e63b28782555f2\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T02:26:33Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:05:56Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"docs(release): record current main suite progress\",\"oid\":\"3d43fd05ff1d53e86ffd16e595e6f7e493755501\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T02:39:29Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:05:56Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"docs(release): record PR287 integration and current checks\",\"oid\":\"917a016e72ef09969a9e7adbe088b8596627d1a1\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T02:42:58Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:05:57Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"docs(release): close superseded main CI checkpoint\",\"oid\":\"b82262ca4cd4dfd45b6e34cdd25fb4a346c3d09c\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T03:00:09Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:05:57Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"docs(release): refresh current CI checkpoint\",\"oid\":\"f302dd7220f1f65a079f77bf8f9d83b702835ac6\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T03:04:16Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@h