{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:14:39.966Z","ordinal":456659,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18381-bbde-78b3-8788-a27d07a323e4","call_id":"call_8540ef5ddd494b96a6b48afb4213579c","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.4 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 7324)\nTotal output lines: 16\n\n{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"baseRefOid\":\"145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08\",\"body\":\"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/15/changes/nexus-code/15\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\n## Purpose\\n\\nRecord the requested codebase-review findings and dogfooding follow-up in the v1.0.0 readiness artifact, bound to current source and qualification evidence.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n- Capability-category split, scheduler extraction, and operation-runner decomposition are integrated.\\n- Bounded diagnostics and `DecisionRejected` guidance are integrated with targeted tests.\\n- Lifecycle integration tests and 100 fixed-seed scheduler invariants are present; they do not prove every scheduler property.\\n- Operator configuration currently supports only `operationPolicy`; this does not claim all runtime defaults are configurable.\\n- The RC8 runtime-identity defect is fixed in merged PR #273 and covered by a focused regression. The fix postdates RC10 and still needs successor-RC verification.\\n- Malformed operator-config recovery remains tracked separately in PR #299; it is not represented as resolved by this documentation change.\\n- Pilot evaluation is not held-out acceptance. Independent 40-task custody and exact-RC qualification remain open.\\n- Readiness records active PR/CI evidence, current requirements status, latest RC, and unresolved acceptance gates without claiming acceptance.\\n\\n## Exact revision and validation\\n\\n- Base: `b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212`\\n- Head: `11dc196fcdd733f8de71dfc95ff70e109d8f4492`\\n- Cumulative diff SHA-256: `2ab25de0645cb96bc4f874f35e4f327817f93a29216c12ef463ad380192b6513`\\n- `git diff --check`: PASS\\n- Source requirements enforcement passed on exact base `b2ae2fe` (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals). This documentation-only update does not change the requirements source.\\n- Exact-head CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks: PASS.\\n- Exact-head Node 22 and 24 CI and Entire Gates: IN_PROGRESS as observed 2026-10-28 13:55 UTC.\\n- Independent factual review of this exact head: REQUESTED; pending.\\n\\nAcceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; no accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release is claimed.\\n\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T02:10:39Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:05:55Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"docs(release): refresh readiness checkpoint after PR 286\",\"oid\":\"e0c2648816bb5d0b0632d213d1e63b28782555f2\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T02:26:33Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:05:56Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"docs(release): record current main suite progress\",\"oid\":\"3d43fd05ff1d53e86ffd16e595e6f7e493755501\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T02:39:29Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:05:56Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"docs(release): record PR287 integration and current checks\",\"oid\":\"917a016e72ef09969a9e7adbe088b8596627d1a1\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T02:42:58Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholo