{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:15:28.586Z","ordinal":456708,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18382-79ca-71d0-a102-9b1303dcf62c","call_id":"call_70042da8dbaa4bc19c3d3362dc478b6f","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 11367)\nTotal output lines: 82\n\n## v1/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028...origin/v1/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028\nd38341f3 (HEAD -> v1/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028, origin/v1/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028) docs(release): refresh exact PR qualification status\ndded46ba docs(release): correct RC10 qualification scope\na56432d7 (pr/300) docs(release): refresh readiness at current main\n95912087 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into v1/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028\n145d464d Merge pull request #299 from mikeholownych/v1/malformed-operator-config-doctor\nc7818480 docs(release): refresh exact-main readiness checkpoint\n11dc196f docs(release): reconcile review timestamp and disposition\n96cc7dcb docs(release): record restart gate failures\n145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08\n docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | 74 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\n 1 file changed, 73 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\n235:**RC9 installed accessibility result and source fix:** Published tag `v1.0.0-rc.9` still points to source `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`; its archive SHA-256 is `35795d2b7639b68a541c512976d8bc7f251115ebdccf48f6b9cf5f98ef1af9bb`. PR [#260](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/260) merged the exact installed-RC PTY evidence as `9def2658e9269f6468ff7c5562839999cc7352a8`; captures and verifier are in [the RC9 accessibility evidence](../reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.9/terminal-scripted/accessibility/README.md). On installed RC9, `NO_COLOR=1` under xterm at 40x14 and 100x30 emitted no color SGR codes (2/2 subcases passed); `TERM=dumb` with `NO_COLOR` unset emitted reset SGR `39m`, `49m`, and `59m` at both sizes (2/2 subcases failed). The complete all-state accessibility gate remains partial. PR [#261](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/261) now disables Crossterm color output when the TUI resolves `Depth::Mono` and adds a real-backend regression test. This fix is on `main`, not in the immutable RC9 artifact; RC9 remains failed for the `TERM=dumb` subcase. A new immutable RC and affected-gate requalification are required before any stable release.\n239:**Custody and remaining acceptance:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN and its latest update is 17:37:53 UTC; no custodian response or assignee is recorded. No private held-out payload was accessed, and held-out qualification has not started. The repository's latest human terminal matrix status is 0/15; scripted PTY evidence does not substitute for those operator cells. Current-source provider/standalone, T2/T3/T4, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. RC9 is unaccepted and stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. Acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`; the existing publication authorization remains gated on every required release acceptance.\n256:**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN; its latest metadata-only custody request at 12:18 UTC has no custodian response. Independent private custody, evaluator-compatible corpus sealing, and held-out acceptance remain unestablished; no held-out payload was accessed or run. Current-candidate provider/standalone, T2/T3/T4, cross-runner and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. The human terminal matrix remains **0/15**. RC8 is a prior prerelease, not a qualified candidate for this source; stable v1.0.0 is unpublished. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authority remains granted but gated.\n263:**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `ff349383537b10ec6198ceb0961e833bd519c2b4`. Post-merge CI run [40340228722](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228722) is bound to that exact commit: Node 22 and Node 24 jobs passed; `linux-x86_64` remains in progress at `npm --prefix cli test`. Post-merge CodeQL run [40340228417](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228417) passed. The requirements-enforcement and version synchronization checks previously passed on exact `ff349383`; the version remains `1.0.0-rc.8`. Do not call source CI complete until the Linux job terminates successfully.\n267:**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN with no custodian response to the latest metadata-only request (12:18 UTC). Private custody, evaluator-compatible corpus sealing, and held-out acceptance remain unestablished. No held-out payload was accessed or run. Exact-current-RC provider/standalone, T2/T3/T4, cross-runner and independent acceptance are not established. The human terminal matrix remains **0/15**. RC8 remains an older prerelease, not a current-source candidate; stable v1.0.0 is unpublished. Acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authority remains granted but gated.\n278:**Terminal environment preparation:** A strict known-host SSH connection to the configured Ubuntu/GNOME desktop succeeded. Read-only inventory found xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, and …8867 tokens truncated…50895b84…`, PR #16).\n624:- A separate harmless synthetic canary reproduction against the pre-PR-#10 `runIsolated()` boundary confirmed a material hidden-oracle integrity defect at `e1759ca`: candidate-like code executed by a checker could read and overwrite a hidden file copied into the same writable `/workspace`; its canary appeared in captured output and would be persisted in `hidden.log`. No host escape was demonstrated, and no held-out payload or model candidate was used in that reproduction. (Subsequently remediated at the source level by `blackbox-v1` oracle separation in PR #10 `2c70d39`, workspace history isolation in PR #18 `96aeef2`, and kernel resource isolation in PR #19 `91406bd`.)\n646:- Automated PTY acceptance tests are included in the passing CLI suite. This is not human interaction in each required terminal emulator.\n653:| `REQ-AGT-002` | partial | Zero false `VERIFIED` across the frozen qualification workloads; source regression tests pass (`1,152/1,152` at `a7126aa`) but no held-out evaluation exists. | T2/T3/T4 RC runs | Qualification operator | Run the preregistered acceptance set on an installed RC and retain per-run evidence; fix and repeat any false `VERIFIED`. |\n666:| `REQ-QUAL-107` | open | No accepted live standalone/proxy matrix or RC-pinned provider verification. | RC, qualifying held-out subset, provider access, serial gateway window | Qualification operator | Execute `ACCEPTANCE.md` §4 through the approved stripped proxy and collect E5 provider verification receipts on the installed RC. |\n672:| `REQ-QUAL-108` | partial | Automated PTY suite passes on `a7126aa`; the human matrix is absent for xterm, kitty (keyboard protocol enabled), tmux 3.x inside GNOME Terminal, VS Code terminal and GNOME Terminal at 80×24, 40×14 and 200×60. | Human terminal access and RC install | Human acceptance operator | Execute the `ACCEPTANCE.md` §5.3 manual matrix on the installed RC across all required terminal×size cells and archive screenshots and verdicts. |\n690:2. **Stage 1 — Pre-RC source gates & integration to `main`:** Merge `v1/integration` to `main` (PR #8) once all pre-RC source checks pass, synchronize version metadata to `1.0.0-rc.1` (`scripts/sync-version.mjs`), add `docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.1.md`, and verify green source CI on `main`.\n693:5. **Stage 4 — Installed-RC qualification:** Install the workflow-produced `v1.0.0-rc.1` package via the documented installer and execute `ACCEPTANCE.md` §§4–8 (standalone/provider matrix, CI/scripted/manual terminal matrix, T2 40×5 held-out comparison, T4 9×5 fault matrix, T3 8×5 long-task matrix, install matrix, SPEC-09 §3.2 docs checklist, and §8 independent acceptance). Archive all evidence under `docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/v1.0.0-rc.1/`.\n694:6. **Stage 5 — G6 decision, version-only stable promotion, draft verification, and publication:** After G6 passes on the accepted RC, create the version-only `v1.0.0` commit directly on the accepted RC commit (enforced by `scripts/check-version-only-diff.mjs` in `release.yml`), run source CI, tag `v1.0.0` to build the unpublished draft release, complete Stage 5 stable artifact/install/attestation checks, record the signed G6 and Stage 5 disposition, and publish the draft release (`gh release edit v1.0.0 --draft=false`).\n709:- E2 is **partial**: all eight fresh-install/minimum-runtime cells and eight expected negative preflight cells passed across the prepared Ubuntu 22.04/24.04, Debian 12 and Fedora 40 images. One Ubuntu 22.04 / Node 22 lifecycle cell passed alpha.2 upgrade, repair, rollback and uninstall. The remaining lifecycle cases are not complete. Current-source evaluator host preflight passed 10/10 using synthetic markers only; this is not held-out custody or qualification evidence.\n710:- Ubuntu/GNOME is reachable and has all five required terminal applications, but `gh auth status` there reports no GitHub login. The RC5 installer stopped before creating files; the version-scoped desktop install prefix is absent. The manual terminal matrix is **0/15**.\n722:| T2/T3 held-out custody | Blocked. Issue #1 has no custodian reply; the public 40-task manifest does not establish private custody acceptance, and the legacy validator contract is incompatible with the current evaluator. No private payload was accessed or run. | Independent custodian confirms author/handoff, compatible immutable corpus or successor, validation, access separation, digests and custody acceptance; only then prepare and execute the approved runs. |\n723:| Evaluator resource/secret boundary | Synthetic current-source host preflight 10/10; no accepted qualification-host/custody result. | Complete independent host and custody acceptance before any held-out execution. |\n727:| Human terminal matrix (§5.3) | 0/15. No screenshots or per-cell operator verdicts. | Install exact RC on the desktop after GitHub CLI authentication; complete all five terminals × three sizes with two distinct screenshots per cell. |\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","create_time":1793207728.5862582}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
