{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:20:30.543Z","ordinal":456999,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a18387-154f-7160-9d06-d49c7bbc8762","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — reviewed the uncommitted 9-line diff at HEAD `51409f5ee900729e3b8d4d9ee789790a5edbe738`, based on `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b`. Diff SHA-256: `b5e79ab1ccc880e02e302c94dfaeeb77a242e74a04b11d3ddf25d8a5ae8b5309`.\n\n- The checkpoint says CodeQL run `40733687484` was still running. It completed **successfully at 17:17:25 UTC**, before the document’s 17:18:52 modification time. Update that status; main CI run `40733687806` was still in progress when checked.\n- “The branch has now incorporated `8580c82`” is ambiguous after the PR #300 status. PR #300 remains at head `d38341f` against base `145d464`; explicitly identify the *readiness branch* as the branch based on `8580c82`, so readers don’t infer PR #300 was refreshed.\n\nThe other checked identities and statuses matched: `8580c82` is the PR #306 merge atop `90837aa`; PR #307 is merged at `90837aa`; PR #302’s cited run failed Node 22/24 and skipped Linux. The qualification section keeps acceptance and the manual matrix explicitly incomplete. No tests were run."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","create_time":1793208030.5432596}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":21843}}
