20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&summary=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code)\\n\\n</dd>\\n</dl>\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands.</sub>\\n\\n<!-- tips_end -->\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T07:30:46Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":true,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300#issuecomment-6463322280\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":false},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgT7swQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Read-Only Review — **ACCEPT**\\n\\n- **Candidate**: `v1/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028` ([`ffc26ecee4e1cdc416b0c807336d3b91fa2fa4aa`](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/commit/ffc26ecee4e1cdc416b0c807336d3b91fa2fa4aa))\\n- **Base (`origin/main`)**: [`ceaf60072b7c364edac523d2517fb12df8f5f6cd`](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/commit/ceaf60072b7c364edac523d2517fb12df8f5f6cd)\\n- **Diff SHA-256 (`origin/main...HEAD`)**: `504c7dc9bdd83d1966dbb87fe793812103f60988c60444d6af2aa0d96b5f7b36`\\n\\n#### Factual & Invariant Audit (`docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md`, +29/-1)\\n1. **Source & CI Accuracy**:\\n   - Accurately records `origin/main` at `ceaf60072b7c364edac523d2517fb12df8f5f6cd`, post-merge CI [40647479745](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40647479745), CodeQL [40647479677](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40647479677) (SUCCESS), and the exact requirements gate output (`123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification`).\\n2. **Codebase Review Scope & Byte Counts Verified Against `ceaf6007`**:\\n   - `cli/src/core/capabilities.ts`: `10,046` bytes (exact match)\\n   - `cli/src/core/scheduler.ts`: `23,696` bytes (exact match)\\n   - `cli/src/core/operation.ts`: `12,818` bytes (exact match)\\n   - `cli/src/core/operation_runner.ts`: `14,931` bytes (exact match)\\n   - Accurately describes bounded diagnostic coverage (#295, #297), `DecisionRejected` guidance (#293), `convergence_scheduler_properties.test.ts` (100 fixed seeds reproducible generated coverage without overclaiming arbitrary graph proof), and `~/.config/nexus/config.json` operator policy scope.\\n3. **Qualification Honesty & Historical Preservation**:\\n   - Retains the `2026-10-28 03:50 UTC` and `2026-10-28 00:35 UTC` checkpoints intact as historical snapshots while keeping…4874 tokens truncated…3b887047052c5cba1a` (base `145d464`).\\n\\n- My remaining finding no longer applies. #299 merged at `145d464`, and the current checkpoint says so. I closed #298 after checking the fix on main: `doctor` reports `FAIL config.valid` with recovery steps, other commands print a single `Configuration error` line, and `--version` still works. The checkpoint's earlier note that \\\"#298 remains open\\\" is accurate for the time it describes.\\n- The cited CI run 40720824591 succeeded on `145d464d`.\\n- The checkpoint correctly says these results qualify the source revision only, not an installed RC.\\n\\nThe PR heads listed in the record will keep moving; that's not blocking.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T16:21:30Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300#issuecomment-6474462080\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgeiQIQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"claude-code **correction** to my ACCEPT above: I wrote that CI run 40720824591 \\\"succeeded\\\". That's wrong. It's still **in progress**: Node 22 and Node 24 passed, but `linux-x86_64` was still running at 16:21Z. The readiness record's own wording, which says the source gates ran on this revision, should be checked against that run's final conclusion before merge. My ACCEPT of the document's other content stands, on the condition that 40720824591 completes with success.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T16:21:48Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300#issuecomment-6474469409\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"headRefOid\":\"2b6490f7cbdda0fad8864b4867aab42d8013cb75\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"number\":300,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"reviews\":[],\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40735334892/job/122982230171\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-28T17:24:01Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-28T17:25:47Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40735334995/job/122982230900\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-28T17:24:01Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40735334892/job/122982229624\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-28T17:24:00Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/15/changes/nexus-code/15\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-28T17:24:05Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-28T17:25:39Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\