{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:52:26.106Z","ordinal":458334,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-03ec9223-d8a5-4168-a914-78ad8ad8d88d","process_id":"37282","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 308 --json author,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefOid,title,body,reviewDecision"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 308 --json author,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefOid,title,body,reviewDecision"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"author\":{\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"is_bot\":false,\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"},\"baseRefOid\":\"8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b\",\"body\":\"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/23/changes/nexus-code/23\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\nSupersedes the stale checkpoint restore PR #302 without rewriting its branch history. PR #302 remains at `934ed912b8e187c5c418709e472a6313bb4169a8`, whose exact Node 22/24 run failed the tracked-deletion/symlink-parent checkpoint creation case and whose Linux job was skipped.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n- Harden restore preflight for tracked and untracked destinations, nested Git layouts, symlinked parents, staged deletions, ordinary child replacements, and special filesystem entries.\\n- Preserve protected Git index/HEAD/worktree state on rejection and preserve safe nested-repository diagnostics.\\n- Add restore and hook-failure regressions.\\n- Candidate touches `cli/src/checkpoint.ts`, `cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts`, and `cli/test/checkpoint_hook_failure_paths.test.ts` only relative to current main.\\n\\n## Candidate and review\\n\\n- Exact base: `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b`.\\n- Candidate: `87b560c7e581fa71cce270474ba40766f372fb04`.\\n- Independent full-diff reviews: ACCEPT, findings 0, no tests run.\\n- `tsc --noEmit`, `git diff --check`, requirements enforcement (123 rows; 12 exact-RC deferrals), and version synchronization (`1.0.0-rc.10`) passed in isolated environments.\\n- No local tests were run because the repository SUITE claim remained recorded under `kimi-main`; exact-head CI is required before integration.\\n\\nAcceptance remains IN_PROGRESS. This PR is a source correction and does not claim RC qualification or release acceptance.\\n\",\"headRefName\":\"v1/checkpoint-restore-rebased-8580\",\"headRefOid\":\"87b560c7e581fa71cce270474ba40766f372fb04\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(checkpoint): harden restore safety on current main\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":466858166}},"started_at_ms":1793209945638,"completed_at_ms":1793209946106}}
