{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:01:22.597Z","ordinal":458732,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18336-b174-72a1-9e58-590be19b8235","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-1f5d6f41-09ce-4930-bf71-bb0dcd2062d2","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-pr302-bare-repo-remediation-20261028: latest_progress=17:59 UTC: origin/main exact-head CI 40733687806 completed successfully across Node22, Node24, and Linux x86_64; CodeQL 40733687484 also passed. PR #308 failure was posted as a precise review follow-up comment #6476537741. SUITE owner still has live make test on immutable snapshot; the prior archive snapshot lacks .git and has a known environment-specific build-identity failure. PR300/305 remain in Linux/Entire checks., next_checkpoint=Continue waiting for the active SUITE owner to finish and release. Require a Git worktree snapshot after the archive-style environment failure, fix check-ignore with NUL stdin and add glob-bearing filename regression, then exact review, pushed PR308, and exact CI. Monitor PR300/305 Linux and Entire checks; release acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS., release_state=Acceptance IN_PROGRESS. No accepted successor RC or stable v1.0.0. Latest public candidate RC10; installed-RC provider/held-out/cross-runner/manual terminal evidence remains incomplete., terminal_setup=Ubuntu desktop 10.0.8.3 reachable over SSH. GUI session active. xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1 installed. RC10 binary at ~/.local/nexus-rc10-qualification/bin/nexus reports 1.0.0-rc.10 (16ee8ca36438). Opened xterm 80x24 using a disposable workspace as setup only; no manual acceptance evidence collected., review_state=Independent ACCEPT of f8f6983 vs 934ed912, exact diff SHA-256 38425b0e892f4a0741601516b23ca71a768dc4f08ef06955e6f5869ef47d8527, findings 0, tests not run. Review specifically covers staged deletion in assertGitChangesSafe and safe cleanup ordering. A newer uncommitted 10/-2 checkpoint.ts delta was excluded., ci_state=PR308 head 87b560c7: runs 40735401162 and 40735870389 Node22/24 FAILED; Linux skipped; Entire failed due no approvals, failed CI, and one unresolved high finding. PR305 head fde0b7b9 and PR300 head 2b6490f7: Node22/24 PASS; Linux and Entire gates still in progress. Exact main 8580c821 CI and CodeQL now both pass., next_checkpoint2=No tests until SUITE handoff from kimi-main., entire_auth=entire auth status --json reports logged_in=false; reviewer could not access approval lists because org.freedesktop.secrets service is unavailable. Human-authorized reviewer action required., suite_claim=codex-root owns SUITE since 2026-10-28 17:46:37Z on v1/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix, head 1482d6b315129cd46fac61242c2eb91793ed8fd2; focused checkpoint restore validation on immutable snapshot /var/tmp/nexus-pr302-validation-finalfocus-174628, isolated HOME, no inference. No coordinator test execution., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS; no accepted successor RC or stable release., current_main_checks=Verified exact origin/main 8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b: CI run 40733687806 SUCCESS, Node22 SUCCESS, Node24 SUCCESS, Linux x86_64 SUCCESS (17:55:45Z); CodeQL 40733687484 SUCCESS., updated 2 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Address PR #302 review finding for nested bare Git repository ancestors (detail=Exact PR head 3c52580ae1da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7 is remotely verified and independently ACCEPTED (diff SHA-256 d90aeb05a9f5c5d0a35bfa0f597d96cc39a5f6480e22b20094f7523cd4cacdff). Immutable-snapshot validation: checkpoint_restore 51/51, TypeScript --noEmit PASS, diff-check PASS; isolated HOME and logs retained at /var/tmp/nexus-pr302-3c52580.91oUZ9. CodeQL and JS/TS PASS; Node 22/24 and Entire are pending. PR remains open; no merge.), updated about 4 hours ago\n  - [doing] Close partial nested bare repository config bypass and requalify PR302 (detail=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed working diff SHA-256 28524ef98877b37c8d385d0ede5cfdf682d620515fab4a135e05212985841484. Committed as 72939ec8da37bc22509c8c87ebaacc5de7724f02 and pushed fast-forward to PR302. Isolated-HOME tsc --noEmit and diff-check pass; no tests run due kimi-main SUITE claim. Exact PR checks 40717946373/40717945285 started; Entire reviewer asked to verify exact pushed content and then record own approval if policy allows. Ubuntu read-only Entire inspection showed zero approvals on trail 17 before current head check., next_checkpoint=Wait for exact-head CI and independent Entire reviewer response; obtain explicit SUITE safe-boundary transfer before targeted/full validation. Use valid worktree under /home and CI-style capped tmpfs/runtime fixtures. Do not merge until exact candidate tests, review, and all checks pass.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [doing] Use Entire history before continuing PR #302 checkpoint remediation (latest_progress=2026-10-28: Applied using-entire workflow. Entire status succeeds on shared main (enabled; 637 outgoing checkpoints), but semantic search fails because org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable. Isolated PR302 worktree reports Entire not set up. Shared checkout remains untouched. Existing reviewer/owner/claim constraints unchanged., next_checkpoint=Restore the configured secret-service access through its approved host setup or obtain authorized Entire access; rerun Entire search for checkpoint restore history. Preserve PR302 worktree changes until coordinator confirms their ownership. Do not run tests while kimi-main owns SUITE.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [done] Remove bare repository marker false positive and add ordinary objects/refs regression (details=Changed marker threshold from two names to complete HEAD/objects/refs set; added restore regression. git diff --check passed. Tests remain queued because kimi-main owns the fresh SUITE claim.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [doing] Advance PR302 exact-head remediation and qualification (latest_progress=On 2026-10-28 at 15:50 UTC, PR302 fast-forwarded to f771590b0da201f5d3f83897f9d2d8a0ce5cee91. Independent source reviewer plan05_readonly_review ACCEPTed exact parent-to-head diff SHA 31171bfd. TypeScript noEmit and git diff check pass. Local tests not run because SUITE safe-boundary handoff from kimi-main is unresolved. Exact-head GitHub CI 40720039126 and CodeQL 40720039095 queued; Entire pending, cannot self-approve through the sole owner account. Future timestamps 16:00/16:08/16:12 appended earlier were erroneous and corrected in nexus-claims.log., next_checkpoint=Monitor exact-head CI and Entire status. Obtain Kimi suite-owner safe-boundary release or confirm there is no active suite claim/process, then run targeted checkpoint suite with isolated HOME; preserve evidence and requalify if changes are needed. Do not merge until tests, checks, and independent acceptance pass., release_state=Acceptance IN_PROGRESS; origin/main=b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; PR302 head=f771590b0da201f5d3f83897f9d2d8a0ce5cee91. User confirms sole-user repository; independent code review can come from distinct agent/session, but Entire approval remains pending. Public latest prerelease RC10; no stable v1.0.0.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [doing] Fix nested-workspace restore index scope on PR #302 (detail=Independent review identified read-tree resets sibling index entries during a subdirectory workspace restore. Added scoped index merge and a sibling staged/worktree regression in claimed worktree; diff-check passed. Current TypeScript check unavailable because the worktree has no installed compiler. Active SUITE claim remains kimi-main provider composite focused tests, so no local suite runs.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [doing] Resolve PR302 independent checkpoint review findings (details=Current PR head moved to 934ed912b8e187c5c418709e472a6313bb4169a8 while work proceeded. Draft changes in cli/src/checkpoint.ts and cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts cover stale merge state, fail-closed invalid UTF-8 paths, untracked permission preservation, no-rename Git deltas, ENOTDIR-safe lstat, renamed ignore-file detection, and ignored staged additions. TypeScript noEmit, esbuild test parse, and diff-check pass. Tests not run; SUITE claim still kimi-main. Exact-head CI 40729450236 is running on base 934. Independent review requested on exact uncommitted diff. No commit/push yet; avoid overwriting concurrent owner work.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [doing] Advance PR #302 remediation and qualification (latest_progress=2026-10-28 17:20 UTC: Candidate was rebased onto new origin/main 8580c821 and is clean at 87b560c7e581fa71cce270474ba40766f372fb04. Fresh exact-base/full-diff static review ACCEPTed (SHA-256 1974a63164f6af35f12e9e7813fbbf9702f420c4406988de3a061c2a901d8895), no findings; no tests. Full SUITE remains live under kimi-main and is progressing through test/upgrade.test.ts. Remote PR #302 still at 934ed912 with old Node22/24 failure; no push., next_checkpoint=Wait for SUITE release, verify final claim/process state, then run exact-candidate tests in isolated HOME and coordinate the verified candidate with the release owner. Require fresh remote CI and maintain the separate terminal evidence and Entire reviewer blockers.), updated 41 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Reconcile and requalify PR #302 checkpoint restore candidate against live main (detail=Candidate rebased on live origin/main 8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b at 87b560c7e581fa71cce270474ba40766f372fb04. Exact combined diff 1974a63164f6af35f12e9e7813fbbf9702f420c4406988de3a061c2a901d8895 independently ACCEPTED by review_pr302; isolated-HOME TypeScript noEmit PASS and git diff --check PASS. Tests remain prohibited pending explicit SUITE handoff from kimi-main; request appended 17:17:28Z. Remote PR302 still old head 934ed912; no push yet., next_checkpoint=Await SUITE safe-boundary release/transfer, then run required focused/full tests on immutable exact candidate, push/update PR #302, and await exact-head CI.), updated 43 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Reconcile exact PR308 CI failure on head 87b560c7 (latest_progress=Refreshed live checks at 2026-10-28 17:41 UTC. Exact PR308 candidate 87b560c7 run 40735870389 has Node24 FAILED in npm test; logs show numerous checkpoint_restore cases fail with the generic 'could not verify whether a staged addition is ignored' path from assertNoIgnoredAddedPaths. Node22 in that run and both jobs in older run 40735401162 remain IN_PROGRESS. Failure and required exact rerun recorded in nexus-claims.log. PR305 Node22 passed and Node24 remains in progress; PR300 Node24 passed and Node22 remains in progress. SUITE claim still active for candidate 1482d6b3; no local tests run., next_checkpoint=Owner must inspect full CI failure, correct assertNoIgnoredAddedPaths and pathspec literal handling, add focused regression(s), finish focused/full validation under the existing SUITE claim, obtain independent review, then update PR308 and rerun exact-head CI. Do not edit the claimed worktree or run suites before explicit claim release/handoff., current_integration=origin/main=8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b; PR308 head=87b560c7e581fa71cce270474ba40766f372fb04, acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS; no accepted successor RC or stable v1.0.0.), updated 18 minutes ago\n- nexus-v1-release: pr133_ci=Node20/22/24 and CodeQL passed exact head; Linux packaging run 39665020828 active, pr133_head=6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a, next=Await exact-head independent review of 0009528d; PR268 owner push required for hosted CI. PR284 exact CI green but CHANGES_REQUIRED review remains. Terminal matrix and qualification gates stay open., current_main=1bc63ef471e0fedb3ad4e980cc12e9c303382c69; PR #288 merged 2026-10-28 00:28:31Z. It restores RC10 E2 docs/evidence only., sbom=PR