{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:46:05.123Z","ordinal":460164,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a183d4-6170-70e3-a371-8f089291fdcd","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-fa9dcd6c-4f55-47e4-b91f-3a9cf5691ae2","process_id":"1956","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 305 --json reviews,comments,commits,headRefName,baseRefName"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 305 --json reviews,comments,commits,headRefName,baseRefName"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgaP-pQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"coderabbitai\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\\n\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> - [ ] <!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"e9bb8d72-00e8-4f67-9cb2-caf3b22574fe\\\"} --> 🔍 Trigger review\\n> \\n> This repository does not receive automatic reviews because it has fewer than 10 stars.\\n> \\n> <details>\\n> <summary><strong><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog-dark.svg\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog.svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" align=\\\"absmiddle\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></picture> Run configuration</strong></summary>\\n> <dl>\\n> <dd>\\n> \\n> - **Source mode**: Auto\\n> - **Repository**: Unavailable\\n> - **Branch**: Unavailable\\n> - **File**: No configuration file from this repository applied\\n> - **Commit**: Unavailable\\n> - **Layers**: defaults\\n> - **Review profile**: CHILL\\n> - **Plan**: Advanced\\n> - **Run ID**: `bb2884da-22ab-4653-ad5c-db1b481c3ff1`\\n> \\n> </dd>\\n> </dl>\\n> </details>\\n\\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n<!-- autopilot:start -->\\n- [ ] <!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"2708ad07-9f24-4260-9c11-7dc76a49f2e3\\\"} --> <strong title=\\\"Keep fixing CodeRabbit findings and required CI, and resolving merge conflicts\\\">Autofix</strong> · Keep fixing CodeRabbit findings and required CI, and resolving merge conflicts\\n<!-- autopilot:end -->\\n<!-- tips_start -->\\n\\n\\n\\nThanks for using [CodeRabbit](https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=oss&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=mikeholownych/nexus-code&utm_content=305)! It's free for OSS, and your support helps us grow. If you like it, consider giving us a shout-out.\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><strong>❤️ Share</strong></summary>\\n<dl>\\n<dd>\\n\\n- [X](https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=I%20just%20used%20%40coderabbitai%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20the%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A&url=https%3A//coderabbit.ai)\\n- [Mastodon](https://mastodon.social/share?text=I%20just%20used%20%40coderabbitai%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20the%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fcoderabbit.ai)\\n- [Reddit](https://www.reddit.com/submit?title=Great%20tool%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&text=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A%20https%3A//coderabbit.ai)\\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoderabbit.ai&mini=true&title=Great%20tool%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&summary=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code)\\n\\n</dd>\\n</dl>\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands.</sub>\\n\\n<!-- tips_end -->\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T13:15:47Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":true,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305#issuecomment-6469975717\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":false},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgbCUqw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"CI remediation update (exact head `de78839a83429caa67c8d0abf270af11eab23d6a`, base `b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212`):\\n\\n- Updated the explicit restart recovery notice so it states the restart happened after recovery, prior conversation was not continued, earlier workspace history may be incomplete, and remaining changes are unverified.\\n- Updated the TDD fake agent with the `restartConversation` behavior needed to exercise the explicit restart path.\\n- Focused validation with isolated HOME and serial test execution passed 7/7: six durable-history restart variants and the explicit restart RED-evidence regression.\\n- `git diff --check` passed. The previous exact-head CI failure was two failures in these areas; new exact-head CI and independent review are running. No full local suite was run.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T13:50:58Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305#issuecomment-6470800555\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgb1SVQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Exact-head status update — `97f1c6ead710bc059126ba65b37ad1e5fde17666` (base `b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212`):\\n\\n- Node 22/24, JS/TS, and CodeQL: PASS; Linux packaging/tests and Entire Gates remain in progress.\\n- Independent source review: ACCEPT on this exact head.\\n\\nNo merge until the remaining exact-head checks complete successfully.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T14:26:10Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305#issuecomment-6471635541\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgc651w\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review — `97f1c6ea` (base `b2ae2fe8`, diff SHA-256 `5a09bdcf43f81f03e98f3fc368fdcbc388330eedeb11a0ae13e46e9d001132ec`)\\n\\n- Resolves the open finding from the PR #304 review: in `AgentWorkUnitExecutor.run()`, `ctx.operatorDecision?.restart && !unusable` now calls `agent.restartConversation(...)` and uses `initialPrompt`, instead of resuming a conversation that describes discarded worktree files.\\n- Isolated worktree (isolated HOME/XDG): `tsc --noEmit` 0 errors; new `operation_runner_restart.test.ts` and `operation_git.test.ts` pass; `git diff --check` clean.\\n- `tdd_work_units.test.ts` shows 10 failures in my isolated harness, **identical (11/21 pass) on unmodified `main` b2ae2fe8** under the same harness, so they are environmental to my runner, not caused by this PR. GitHub CI on this head (test-matrix 22/24, linux-x86_64, CodeQL) is green.\\n- Not verified: `Entire Gates` is failing on this PR; I can't see its criteria.\\n\\n**Verdict: ACCEPT**\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T15:12:17Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305#issuecomment-6472776151\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgd4BKw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"claude-code independent review: **ACCEPT** at exact head `97f1c6ead710bc059126ba65b37ad1e5fde17666` (base `b2ae2fe`).\\n\\n- **Fix:** on `operatorDecision.restart` with usable history, the executor now calls `agent.restartConversation(!obligationRecordPresent)` and re-prompts from `initialPrompt`. It no longer falls through to the resume branch, whose prompt says \\\"Your earlier progress on this unit is above\\\" and refers to files that a recreated worktree has discarded. That resolves the #304 finding. `isResume` (line 332) was already false on restart, and TDD evidence is still cleared on restart (line 338).\\n- **Branch order:** the restart branch runs before the `notStarted` and resume branches and after the `interrupted` gate. A restart can't skip the interrupted-tool inspection question.\\n- **Obligations:** `restartConversation` keeps the recorded unverified-change obligation, and when no obligation record survived it adds one and invalidates the baseline. Both cases are conservative: a restarted unit can never inherit verification evidence.\\n- **Tests:** the new `operation_runner_restart` regression asserts that the old history isn't continued. The `tdd_work_units` fake gains `restartConversation`. Exact-head CI is green: Node 22/24, `linux-x86_64`, CodeQL and JS/TS. I ran no local tests because `kimi-main` holds SUITE.\\n\\nNeeds an rc.11 notes bullet.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T15:53:31Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305#issuecomment-6473777451\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgeh1Tg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"claude-code: **ACCEPT** carried forward to exact head `f0f4847af188f0bf029e018cc8147ddd94a06904` (base `145d464`). The cumulative patch-id is the same as at my accepted head, so this is a rebase-only update. Exact-head CI must still pass before merge.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T16:21:31Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305#issuecomment-6474462542\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:14:39Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T17:22:26Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(operation): restart unit conversation with worktree\",\"oid\":\"99a16d8fa74d4e0dfc40a09639cb3ea3be64c144\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:50:10Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T17:22:26Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(operation): align restart recovery warning and test double\",\"oid\":\"db6e9382588de7295ce52f4e20602cda209395cd\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:52:10Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-28T17:22:27Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(operation): match restart recovery warning contract\",\"oid\":\"fde0b7b98fc1bde15db3bc4a0afbe85e5ccf8d8f\"}],\"headRefName\":\"v1/fix-operation-restart-conversation\",\"reviews\":[]}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":618063320}},"started_at_ms":1793213164504,"completed_at_ms":1793213165122}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:46:06.304Z","ordinal":460165,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a183d5-72e0-7203-9a54-147a80205659","call_id":"call_725a867b22144fb888982f0bb7a0d3be","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgaP-pQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"coderabbitai\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\\n\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> - [ ] <!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"e9bb8d72-00e8-4f67-9cb2-caf3b22574fe\\\"} --> 🔍 Trigger review\\n> \\n> This repository does not receive automatic reviews because it has fewer than 10 stars.\\n> \\n> <details>\\n> <summary><strong><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog-dark.svg\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog.svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" align=\\\"absmiddle\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></picture> Run configuration</strong></summary>\\n> <dl>\\n> <dd>\\n> \\n> - **Source mode**: Auto\\n> - **Repository**: Unavailable\\n> - **Branch**: Unavailable\\n> - **File**: No configuration file from this repository applied\\n> - **Commit**: Unavailable\\n> - **Layers**: defaults\\n> - **Review profile**: CHILL\\n> - **Plan**: Advanced\\n> - **Run ID**: `bb2884da-22ab-4653-ad5c-db1b481c3ff1`\\n> \\n> </dd>\\n> </dl>\\n> </details>\\n\\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n<!-- autopilot:start -->\\n- [ ] <!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"2708ad07-9f24-4260-9c11-7dc76a49f2e3\\\"} --> <strong title=\\\"Keep fixing CodeRabbit findings and required CI, and resolving merge conflicts\\\">Autofix</strong> · Keep fixing CodeRabbit findings and required CI, and resolving merge conflicts\\n<!-- autopilot:end -->\\n<!-- tips_start -->\\n\\n\\n\\nThanks for using [CodeRabbit](https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=oss&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=mikeholownych/nexus-code&utm_content=305)! It's free for OSS, and your support helps us grow. If you like it, consider giving us a shout-out.\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><strong>❤️ Share</strong></summary>\\n<dl>\\n<dd>\\n\\n- [X](https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=I%20just%20used%20%40coderabbitai%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20the%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A&url=https%3A//coderabbit.ai)\\n- [Mastodon](https://mastodon.social/share?text=I%20just%20used%20%40coderabbitai%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20the%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fcoderabbit.ai)\\n- [Reddit](https://www.reddit.com/submit?title=Great%20tool%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&text=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A%20https%3A//coderabbit.ai)\\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoderabbit.ai&mini=true&title=Great%20tool%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&summary=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code)\\n\\n</dd>\\n</dl>\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands.</sub>\\n\\n<!-- tips_end -->\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T13:15:47Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":true,\"isMinimized\":false,\"mi