s to files that a recreated worktree has discarded. That resolves the #304 finding. `isResume` (line 332) was already false on restart, and TDD evidence is still cleared on restart (line 338).\\n- **Branch order:** the restart branch runs before the `notStarted` and resume branches and after the `interrupted` gate. A restart can't skip the interrupted-tool inspection question.\\n- **Obligations:** `restartConversation` keeps the recorded unverified-change obligation, and when no obligation record survived it adds one and invalidates the baseline. Both cases are conservative: a restarted unit can never inherit verification evidence.\\n- **Tests:** the new `operation_runner_restart` regression asserts that the old history isn't continued. The `tdd_work_units` fake gains `restartConversation`. Exact-head CI is green: Node 22/24, `linux-x86_64`, CodeQL and JS/TS. I ran no local tests because `kimi-main` holds SUITE.\\n\\nNeeds an rc.11 notes bullet.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T15:53:31Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305#issuecomment-6473777451\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgeh1Tg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"claude-code: **ACCEPT** carried forward to exact head `f0f4847af188f0bf029e018cc8147ddd94a06904` (base `145d464`). The cumulative patch-id is the same as at my accepted head, so this is a rebase-only update. Exact-head CI must still pass before merge.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T16:21:31Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305#issuecomment-6474462542\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-28T13:14:39Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholo