{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:06:06.203Z","ordinal":460930,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a183e4-a268-7032-b7b1-4c1c8a680095","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a183e4-a268-7032-b7b1-4c1c8a680095","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016ae24797416081a0955cbe50e77507a0","usage":{"input_tokens":121966,"cached_input_tokens":117504,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":555,"reasoning_output_tokens":446,"total_tokens":122521},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":2589450,"cached_input_tokens":2569600,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":5513,"reasoning_output_tokens":3004,"total_tokens":2594963},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":8516865421,"cached_input_tokens":8425942784,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":24237612,"reasoning_output_tokens":13977216,"total_tokens":8541103033}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:06:07.211Z","ordinal":460931,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a183e4-a268-7032-b7b1-4c1c8a680095","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-61fb3279-6b83-4127-ba6f-18360994a66c","process_id":"93485","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","command -v entire || true; git show origin/main:.entire/config.json 2>/dev/null || git show origin/main:.entire/config.yaml 2>/dev/null || true; entire trail --help 2>&1 | sed -n '1,120p'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"command -v entire || true; git show origin/main:.entire/config.json 2>/dev/null || git show origin/main:.entire/config.yaml 2>/dev/null || true; entire trail --help 2>&1 | sed -n '1,120p'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"/home/mike/.local/bin/entire\nA trail captures project intent across repositories and branches. Manage intent and discussions on the whole trail; use --repo and --branch to select context for checkout, sessions, findings, and approvals.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  comment         Discuss the whole trail across repositories\n  create          Create a trail and publish its branch\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  link            Link a repository branch to a trail\n  list            List trails in a project\n  merge           Merge one of a trail's changes into its base\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  show            Show trail intent and its repositories and branches\n  unlink          Unlink a repository branch without deleting its work\n  update          Update project intent and lifecycle\n  watch           Tail events for a trail's selected repository branch\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help             help for trail\n      --project string   Project as gh/<owner> or et/<project>; required for list, otherwise defaults to the repository's namespace\n      --repo string      Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; for list, only filters the required --project\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire trail [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":44774}},"started_at_ms":1793214367210,"completed_at_ms":1793214367211}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:06:08.406Z","ordinal":460932,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a183e7-ca95-7382-af2b-1aa0e517b853","call_id":"call_c69e444997b949cb8688173913d884ae","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"/home/mike/.local/bin/entire\nA trail captures project intent across repositories and branches. Manage intent and discussions on the whole trail; use --repo and --branch to select context for checkout, sessions, findings, and approvals.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  comment         Discuss the whole trail across repositories\n  create          Create a trail and publish its branch\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  link            Link a repository branch to a trail\n  list            List trails in a project\n  merge           Merge one of a trail's changes into its base\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  show            Show trail intent and its repositories and branches\n  unlink          Unlink a repository branch without deleting its work\n  update          Update project intent and lifecycle\n  watch           Tail events for a trail's selected repository branch\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help             help for trail\n      --project string   Project as gh/<owner> or et/<project>; required for list, otherwise defaults to the repository's namespace\n      --repo string      Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; for list, only filters the required --project\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire trail [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a183e4-a268-7032-b7b1-4c1c8a680095","create_time":1793214368.405891}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
