{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:06:14.095Z","ordinal":460938,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a183e4-a268-7032-b7b1-4c1c8a680095","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-a614e6d7-5800-44b4-9a27-a4ca8d2445d2","process_id":"3045","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","entire trail approve --help; find .entire -maxdepth 2 -type f -not -name agent-guide.md -print; git ls-tree -r --name-only origin/main .entire | head -30"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"entire trail approve --help; find .entire -maxdepth 2 -type f -not -name agent-guide.md -print; git ls-tree -r --name-only origin/main .entire | head -30"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"Approve a trail.\n\n<trail> is a project trail number, ID, or <repo>/<number>. Without one, follow the current branch's\nparent. --repo and --branch select a working context. Only that branch is approved,\nnot every repository on the trail. The branch work must be open.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail approve [<trail>] [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --branch string    Select a repository branch within the trail\n  -h, --help             help for approve\n  -m, --message string   Optional approval comment\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name     Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n      --project string   Project as gh/<owner> or et/<project>; required for list, otherwise defaults to the repository's namespace\n      --repo string      Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; for list, only filters the required --project\n.entire/logs/entire.log\n.entire/settings.local.json\n.entire/settings.json\n.entire/.gitignore\n.entire/tmp/pre-prompt-01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92.json\n.entire/tmp/pre-task-01a181d6-e9f0-7d52-