{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:11:17.117Z","ordinal":461200,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a183ec-807c-7d82-bb96-86fffd9605d2","call_id":"call_fffecae55d844cd6af432ce2b99106bd","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"No held-out status change since the prior review. At `origin/main@ceaf60072b7c364edac523d2517fb12df8f5f6cd` (merge #295, `2026-10-28T03:01:55-04:00`), the T2 and T3 manifest hashes and coverage remain unchanged.\\n\\nIssue #1 remains open; last updated `2026-10-27T18:47:09Z`. Its latest comment, #6450709480, is still a coordinator request; no custodian response or handoff is visible. Claims show no active held-out owner.\\n\\nThe T2 report’s historical custody acceptance still separates evaluator-boundary acceptance. The current evaluator continues to reject T2’s legacy format for qualification, and the readiness record remains blocked. No new qualification or fresh acceptance evidence is recorded.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a183e4-a268-7032-b7b1-4c1c8a680095","create_time":1793214677.116856}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
