{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:11:19.662Z","ordinal":461207,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a183ec-8a6d-7371-af71-a49205ce5a2d","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — PR #300 head `a285ebedc449e6a64687bb763b3ecfac38f2e675` against base `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b`. Diff SHA-256: `fa2bb1f4a849239a675ba7a515dccd354354ec0af25eb360dc14ff630f9cab46`.\n\n- [READINESS.md](/home/mike/nexus-code/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:9) says the cited RC10 reproducibility run `40564959805` failed on an npm-version mismatch. GitHub records that run as **success**; its compare job completed successfully and compared the six selected artifacts, including `sbom.cdx.json`, with the published RC. The “failed” and `REQ-REL-114` failure claims need correction. The evidence remains limited to RC10 and does not establish successor-RC or overall release acceptance.\n- [READINESS.md](/home/mike/nexus-code/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:7) reports PR #300’s prior head `2b6490f` and a failed Entire check. That commit’s GitHub check concluded **neutral** (“No trail tracks this branch”). The reviewed head is now `a285ebed`; its Node 22/24 checks and Entire Gates are in progress. Refresh this current-checkpoint entry or clearly label it as the pre-update observation.\n\nThe main source SHA, CI and CodeQL results, release list, issue #1 state, and separation of source checks from exact-RC acceptance were otherwise consistent with the records I checked. No tests were run."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a183e4-a268-7032-b7b1-4c1c8a680095","create_time":1793214679.6619453}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":21976}}
