{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:12:46.446Z","ordinal":461291,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a183ed-dd6e-7201-bb68-c22c0f0fb256","call_id":"call_0e07047f4e854a5a85322cdb07543514","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"No held-out status change since the prior review. At `origin/main@ceaf60072b7c364edac523d2517fb12df8f5f6cd` (merge #295, `2026-10-28T03:01:55-04:00`), the T2 and T3 manifest hashes and coverage remain unchanged.\\n\\nIssue #1 remains open; last updated `2026-10-27T18:47:09Z`. Its latest comment, #6450709480, is still a coordinator request; no custodian response or handoff is visible. Claims show no active held-out owner.\\n\\nThe T2 report’s historical custody acceptance still separates evaluator-boundary acceptance. The current evaluator continues to reject T2’s legacy format for qualification, and the readiness record remains blocked. No new qualification or fresh acceptance evidence is recorded.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — PR #300 head `a285ebedc449e6a64687bb763b3ecfac38f2e675` against base `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b`. Diff SHA-256: `fa2bb1f4a849239a675ba7a515dccd354354ec0af25eb360dc14ff630f9cab46`.\\n\\n- [READINESS.md](/home/mike/nexus-code/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:9) says the cited RC10 reproducibility run `40564959805` failed on an npm-version mismatch. GitHub records that run as **success**; its compare job completed successfully and compared the six selected artifacts, including `sbom.cdx.json`, with the published RC. The “failed” and `REQ-REL-114` failure claims need correction. The evidence remains limited to RC10 and does not establish successor-RC or overall release acceptance.\\n- [READINESS.md](/home/mike/nexus-code/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:7) reports PR #300’s prior head `2b