gates visible.\n\n## Scope and current evidence\n\n- Capability-category split, scheduler extraction, operation-runner decomposition, bounded diagnostics, `DecisionRejected` guidance, lifecycle integration tests, and fixed-seed scheduler invariants are integrated. The invariants do not prove every scheduler property.\n- Operator configuration currently supports `operationPolicy`; this does not claim that all runtime defaults are configurable.\n- The RC8 runtime-identity defect is fixed in PR #273 and covered by a focused regression. That fix postdates RC10 and requires successor-RC verification.\n- Malformed operator-config recovery is tracked separately in PR #299.\n- Pilot evaluation is not held-out acceptance. Independent corpus custody and exact-RC qualification remain open.\n\n## Revision and validation\n\n- Refreshed branch head: `2b6490f7cbdda0fad8864b4867aab42d8013cb75`.\n- Exact main base: `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b` (PR #306 merged atop PR #307).\n- `git diff --check`: PASS.\n- Requirements enforcement on a clean worktree at exact main `8580c82`: PASS, 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open); 12 exact-RC qualification rows remain deferred.\n- Version synchronization on exact main `8580c82`: PASS; all components are `1.0.0-rc.10`.\n- Independent review: prior readiness content accepted at its exact earlier head; the new exact-main checkpoint delta was accepted by `/root/plan05_readonly_review` at diff SHA-256 `6b43a9b7feb6d1b7d72cc536f8b1e362be817783b35a8313b58a0f7378706733`.\n- Current-head CI is running. Main CI run [40733687806](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687806) is bound to `8580c82`; PR-head required checks are also running on `2b6490f`.\n\nAcceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`. Held-out custody and evaluator compatibility, installed-RC provider/standalone and T2/T3/T4 qualification, cross-runner verification, the 0/15 human terminal matrix, independent exact-RC acceptance, and stable publication remain incomplete. No accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release is claimed.\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":555971049}},"started_at_ms":1793215082979,"completed_at_ms":1793215084536}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:18:06.093Z","ordinal":461543,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a183f2-be0d-7d82-a471-e39c5afe7357","call_id":"call_ef3394d4be464770a4ddfa32a7b9c2c8","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.4 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"headSha\":\"cf05322cc0368af900b2fb425852daa2d0de403e\",\"jobs\":[{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"resolve-tag\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[]},{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"build (ubuntu-24.04)\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[]},{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"build (ubuntu-22.04)\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[]},{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"compare\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Compare both runner builds with each other and the published RC\"}]}],\"status\":\"completed\"}\n<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/15/changes/nexus-code/15\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\n\n## Purpose\n\nRefresh the existing release-readiness record with the requested codebase review and dogfooding follow-up. The artifact distinguishes source evidence from installed-RC acceptance and keeps unresolved gates visible.\n\n## Scope and current evidence\n\n- Capability-category split, scheduler extraction, operation-runner decomposition, bounded diagnostics, `DecisionRejected` guidance, lifecycle integration tests, and fixed-seed scheduler invariants are integrated. The invariants do not prove every scheduler property.\n- Operator configuration currently supports `operationPolicy`; this does not claim that all runtime defaults are configurable.\n- The RC8 runtime-identity defect is fixed in PR #273 and covered by a focused regression. That fix postdates RC10 and requires successor-RC verification.\n- Malformed operator-config recovery is tracked separately in PR #299.\n- Pilot evaluation is not held-out acceptance. Independent corpus custody and exact-RC qualification remain open.\n\n## Revision and validation\n\n- Refreshed branch head: `2b6490f7cbdda0fad8864b4867aab42d8013cb75`.\n- Exact main base: `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b` (PR #306 merged atop PR #307).\n- `git diff --check`: PASS.\n- Requirements enforcement on a clean worktree at exact main `8580c82`: PASS, 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open); 12 exact-RC qualification rows remain deferred.\n- Version synchronization on exact main `8580c82`: PASS; all components are `1.0.0-rc.10`.\n- Independent review: prior readiness content accepted at its exact earlier head; the new exact-main checkpoint delta was accepted by `/root/plan05_readonly_review` at diff SHA-256 `6b43a9b7feb6d1b7d72cc536f8b1e362be817783b35a8313b58a0f7378706733`.\n- Current-head CI is running. Main CI run [40733687806](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687806) is bound to `8580c82`; PR-head required checks are also running on `2b6490f`.\n\nAcceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`. Held-out custody and evaluator compatibility, installed-RC provider/standalone and T2/T3/T4 qualification, cross-runner verification, the 0/15 human terminal matrix, independent exact-RC acceptance, and stable publication remain incomplete. No accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release is claimed.\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a183e4-a268-7032-b7b1-4c1c8a680095","create_time":1793215086.093198}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
