{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:18:11.825Z","ordinal":461549,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a183e4-a268-7032-b7b1-4c1c8a680095","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-51fbc66a-76a9-43db-8808-eeec14073456","process_id":"39548","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git diff --stat origin/main...origin/pr/300; git diff origin/main...origin/pr/300 -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | rg -n -C2 '40564959805|REQ-REL-114|Current source|current main|64ffe5|13e45|Entire|neutral|failed|success|rc.10'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git diff --stat origin/main...origin/pr/300; git diff origin/main...origin/pr/300 -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | rg -n -C2 '40564959805|REQ-REL-114|Current source|current main|64ffe5|13e45|Entire|neutral|failed|success|rc.10'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":" docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | 95 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\n 1 file changed, 94 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\n9-+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 19:15 UTC)\n10-+\n11:+**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`, the merge commit for PR #305. Exact-main CI run [40751988282](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988282) is still running its Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices; CodeQL run [40751988267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988267) passed on this exact SHA. No post-merge CI conclusion is available yet. The last completed exact-main run is CI [40733687806](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687806) and CodeQL [40733687484](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687484) on prior main `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b`; those passed source CI, Linux packaging/reproducibility/smoke, version synchronization, and the requirements checker. On that prior revision, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, and 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification. PR #305 changed operation restart behavior and tests, not requirement rows; the current-main run must still finish before claiming its exact-source gates passed. Source-stage evidence does not qualify an installed release candidate.\n12-+\n13:+**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f` (merge commit `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`). PR #307's head was `88bf19c817f8de7461faf9826e405e52630bb08f`; its actual merge commit is `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`. PR #305 merged at `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0` after exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent source-review checks passed. Its Entire Gates check failed only because the review trail lacked approval; that check is not required by protected-branch ruleset 25340146, consistent with the documented PR #307 disposition. PR #302 was closed unmerged; PR #308 supersedes it at `41a63b4cfbd8c2ec40f384de28db4bea0faee49a` on base `8580c821`. At this observation, PR #308 Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL passed; Linux and Entire Gates were still running. PR #309 is at `65b4e1d9e379b630dc33acc714b7cbfa4e17fc6b` on base `8580c821`; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, while Node 22/24 and Entire Gates were still running. PR #300's prior head `a285ebedc449e6a64687bb763b3ecfac38f2e675` had Node 22/24 in progress and JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed; this readiness correction merges current main and requires fresh exact-head checks. Source PR checks are separate from release qualification.\n14-+\n15:+**Qualification and release:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains the latest release; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Official cross-runner run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805) completed successfully (all jobs passed) for the published RC10 source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, rebuilding on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04. Its machine-readable evidence artifact reports `REQ-REL-114` / `ACC-SUP-08` `PASS` and matching hashes for the six compared outputs, including the published archive and `sbom.cdx.json`; see the [RC10 reproducibility record](../reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md). The current requirements ledger still marks `REQ-REL-114` `UNV`/open; ledger disposition remains for its owner to reconcile. RC10 evidence applies only to RC10 and does not establish cross-runner qualification for a successor RC. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned; its latest custodian status request is unanswered as of 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC. Held-out custody acceptance and T2/T3/T4 qualification therefore remain unverified. The manual terminal matrix remains 0/15; no genuine operator cell results are recorded. Remaining standalone/provider, fault-injection, successor-RC qualification, human terminal, and independent exact-RC acceptance gates remain outstanding. Stable publication remains gated.\n16-+\n17-+**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Passing source CI and RC10-only provider/reproducibility evidence do not establish release acceptance. Existing publication authorization remains gated by acceptance.\n--\n21-+## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 16:25 UTC; superseded)\n22-+\n23:+**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`. Exact-head CI run [40720824591](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40720824591) passed the Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices; the Linux packaging/reproducibility job was still running at observation time. CodeQL run [40720824319](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40720824319) passed. The CI jobs completed `sync-version --check` and the requirements checker successfully on this source. These results qualify the source revision only; they do not qualify an installed release candidate.\n24-+\n25:+**Release PRs:** PR [#299](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/299) is merged at `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f`, included in current main. PR [#302](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/302) is based on `145d464` at exact head `49a2af0c1d556912d12b834aa7f2022ef63b528c`; its latest follow-up scopes checkout to the nested workspace and extends the regression to preserve both staged and unstaged sibling state. The prior nested-index delta at `662d084` was independently ACCEPTed (SHA-256 `61f4e40bc135152ffa003c82bdc31fc15703542b5bd9ba3b67f7b6b1edae1cb2`), and the checkout-scope delta was independently ACCEPTed by `review_pr302` (SHA-256 `26ce020bdc1f6865e194f02e45c6889eaa32415cc786a457fbcfae1ddaa78605`, tests not run). PR #302 CodeQL and JS/TS checks pass; Node 22/24 CI and Entire are running. TypeScript `--noEmit` and `git diff --check` passed on the prior delta; no local suite was run under the active SUITE claim.\n26-+\n27:+PR [#307](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/307) is based on `145d464` at `88bf19c817f8de7461faf9826e405e52630bb08f`. Its clean-checkout build-identity correction has an independent ACCEPT review for the exact diff (SHA-256 `c0c7b8be14de2cf1aab3246b2f34596ba4aae30c2d527c1afbe93e1ce0105295`); JS/TS, CodeQL and Node 22/24 pass, Linux packaging and Entire remain pending. PR [#300](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300) contains this readiness record at exact head `dded46ba54001bd511aefce4719839f4b77c85ef`; its corrected checkpoint has just been pushed and all exact-head checks are pending. PRs [#305](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305) and [#306](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/306) are explicitly v1.1 scope and are not part of the v1.0.0 merge path.\n28-+\n29:+**Requirements and qualification:** Current-main CI's requirements checker passes; the most recent explicit `--enforce` result was on PR #302 head `c3901774` before the nested-workspace-only follow-up: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, with 12 requirements deferred to installed-RC qualification. RC10 has scope-limited exact-artifact evidence: OpenRouter pinned-model verification and one synthetic live task passed, and the cross-runner workflow passed for the six listed release artifacts across Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 and against published RC10 (run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805)). **Correction recorded 2026-10-28:** that statement that the workflow passed is incorrect; its official `compare` job failed on the npm-version metadata mismatch described in the current checkpoint below. These results apply only to immutable RC10 source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`; they do not qualify a successor candidate or establish full release acceptance. The newly pushed #302 head must complete exact checks before its requirements evidence is refreshed. Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains the latest release; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. GitHub installer is the selected distribution target; npm publication is inapplicable.\n30-+\n31:+Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned; its last update was 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC, with no custodian response observed. No held-out payload was accessed and no held-out qualification was run. The manual terminal matrix's last recorded result is 0/15; terminal setup exists on Ubuntu, but no operator screenshots or cell verdicts have been supplied. Held-out/T2/T3/T4, remaining provider and standalone coverage, successor-RC cross-runner reproducibility, the human terminal matrix, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain outstanding.\n32-+\n33-+**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Source CI is mostly complete on `145d464`; PR #302's latest delta awaits independent review and exact Node 22/24 completion, while #307 has independent source review but exact PR checks remain pending. RC10 has passing, bounded provider and cross-runner evidence, but no accepted RC exists and mandatory qualification remains open. Publication authorization remains granted and gated by acceptance.\n--\n39-+**Authoritative source and requirements gate:** `origin/main` is `b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212` (PR #304 merge). Current-main CI [40693030763](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40693030763) and CodeQL [40693030710](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40693030710) both completed SUCCESS on that exact revision. A clean detached worktree at that exact source ran `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` with isolated `HOME`: 123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. This passes the source-stage enforcement gate only.\n40-+\n41:+**Release PRs and exact-head checks:** PRs [#299](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/299) (`004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f`), [#300](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300) (`11dc196fcdd733f8de71dfc95ff70e109d8f4492`), [#302](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/302) (`3c52580ae1da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7`), and [#305](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305) (`97f1c6ead710bc059126ba65b37ad1e5fde17666`) are all based on `b2ae2fe`. Exact-head Node 22/24, Linux x86_64, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks passed for these candidates. Their Entire Gates checks are failures, so none is mergeable through the required workflow. PR #302's trail reports five high-severity findings and missing