bffe21dd2f` (merge commit `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`). PR #307's head was `88bf19c817f8de7461faf9826e405e52630bb08f`; its actual merge commit is `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`. PR #305 merged at `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0` after exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent source-review checks passed. Its Entire Gates check failed only because the review trail lacked approval; that check is not required by protected-branch ruleset 25340146, consistent with the documented PR #307 disposition. PR #302 was closed unmerged; PR #308 supersedes it at `41a63b4cfbd8c2ec40f384de28db4bea0faee49a` on base `8580c821`. At this observation, PR #308 Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL passed; Linux and Entire Gates were still running. PR #309 is at `65b4e1d9e379b630dc33acc714b7cbfa4e17fc6b` on base `8580c821`; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, while Node 22/24 and Entire Gates were still running. PR #300's prior head `a285ebedc449e6a64687bb7…6851 tokens truncated…in revision.\n105:+- **Requirements and version checks:** On a clean detached worktree at exactly `8580c82`, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows; tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7. The 12 listed rows remain deferred to exact-RC qualification. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` passed with all components at `1.0.0-rc.10`.\n106-+- **Exact-main hosted CI:** CodeQL run [40733687484](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687484) passed on `8580c82` at 17:17:25 UTC. CI run [40733687806](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687806) remained in progress on that exact SHA when checked; no main test-matrix conclusion is claimed until it finishes.\n107:+- **Checkpoint restore PR #302:** The remote PR head remains `934ed912b8e187c5c418709e472a6313bb4169a8`; its exact run [40729450236](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40729450236) failed the Node 22 and Node 24 suites on the tracked-deletion/symlink-parent checkpoint creation case, with Linux skipped. A separate local candidate has been rebased onto `8580c82` at `87b560c7e581fa71cce270474ba40766f372fb04`; the cumulative change is limited to `checkpoint.ts` and its two restore tests. Independent full-diff review and the authorized full-suite owner’s safe-boundary release are pending. The candidate has not been pushed, and no test result is claimed for it.\n108:+- **Readiness change review:** PR #300 remains remotely at head `d38341f` against base `145d464`; it has not been refreshed on GitHub. Its previous exact-head checks passed Node 22, Node 24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL; its Entire status failed because no separate reviewer approved that trail. The local readiness branch at `51409f5` has merged current `origin/main` `8580c82` and contains the checkpoint update now under review. It requires exact-head required checks before integration. Earlier contents remain historical evidence and must not be read as current source status.\n109-+- **Qualification and release:** Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`. The installed-RC evidence remains tied to RC10, not this source revision. Held-out custody and evaluator compatibility are unresolved; no protected payload was accessed or run. The manual real-terminal matrix remains 0/15, with two screenshots and human verdicts required per cell. Current exact-RC provider, standalone, T2/T3/T4, cross-runner and independent acceptance are not established. Stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. Existing publication authorization remains granted but gated by acceptance.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a183e4-a268-7032-b7b1-4c1c8a680095","create_time":1793215093.2527425}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
